# Demo CT series (docs/current/RENDERING_TECH_GAP_ANALYSIS_2026-08-20.md
# follow-up decision, 2026-08-21): a real, CC BY 3.0-licensed LIDC-IDRI
# patient CT series, tracked via Git LFS rather than as a plain blob so
# it doesn't permanently bloat every clone's .git history. Scoped to this
# one directory -- engine/tests/fixtures/CT_small.dcm (40KB) stays a
# normal blob, it's far too small to need LFS. Lives at the repo root
# (not under engine/) since it's a shared resource, not engine-only --
# docs/verification/inference-worker.md already referenced this same
# LIDC-IDRI-0001 patient for AI-track verification before this data was
# ever committed here, and ai-pipeline's own quantization calibration
# pool draws from the same LIDC-IDRI collection (see
# ai-pipeline/quantization/README.md) -- same "shared, one owner"
# precedent as dicom-parser/ (see .github/CODEOWNERS). See
# test-data/lidc_idri/README.md for citation/attribution.
test-data/lidc_idri/**/*.dcm filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
